sers/armpogart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2013-12-03T21:49:11Z","updated_at":"2013-12-03T21:49:11Z","body":"Here is my case:\nI have 2 ActiveRecord models Driver and Car. Driver model is related to car through Pivot Table:\n\n```\npublic function getCars()\n{\n    return $this->hasMany(Car::className(), ['id' => 'car_id'])\n        ->viaTable('wpta_driver_car', ['driver_id' => 'id']);\n}\n```\n\nWhen I load Driver model in Controller following way:\n\n```\n$drivers = Driver::find()->with('cars')->all();\n```\n\neverything loads just fine, and I can see that cars are loaded. But when I want to load drivers with their cars as array:\n\n```\n$drivers = Driver::find()->with('cars')->asArray()->all();\n```\n\nI get error: `Call to a member function getDb() on a non-object` in `vendor\\yiisoft\\yii2\\yii\\db\\ActiveRelationTrait.php` at line `250`. It is the following line: `return $this->asArray()->all($primaryModel->getDb());`.\n\nWhy I can't load related data as array. Sometimes it's crucial for applications.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/29755008/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"armpogart","id":785768,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NTc2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/785768?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart","html_url":"https://github.com/armpogart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/29755817","html_url":"https://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/issues/1402#issuecomment-29755817","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/1402","id":29755817,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI5NzU1ODE3","user":{"login":"armpogart","id":785768,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NTc2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/785768?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart","html_url":"https://github.com/armpogart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2013-12-03T21:58:14Z","updated_at":"2013-12-03T21:58:14Z","body":"Here is full screenshot of call stack:\n![h6ibtep](https://f.cloud.github.com/assets/785768/1668428/ee36ba9c-5c65-11e3-9691-7200f5b19e75.png)\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/29755817/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"armpogart","id":785768,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NTc2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/785768?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart","html_url":"https://github.com/armpogart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/29757757","html_url":"https://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/issues/1402#issuecomment-29757757","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/1402","id":29757757,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI5NzU3NzU3","user":{"login":"armpogart","id":785768,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NTc2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/785768?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart","html_url":"https://github.com/armpogart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/armpogart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2013-12-03T22:20:58Z","updated_at":"2013-12-03T22:20:58Z","body":"So after further investigation I've found out that there is simple fix. I've changed following function:\n\n```\nprivate function findPivotRows($primaryModels)\n    {\n        if (empty($primaryModels)) {\n            return [];\n        }\n        $this->filterByModels($primaryModels);\n        /** @var ActiveRecord $primaryModel */\n        $primaryModel = reset($primaryModels);\n        return $this->asArray()->all($primaryModel->getDb());\n    }\n```\n\nto\n\n```\nprivate function findPivotRows($primaryModels)\n    {\n        if (empty($primaryModels)) {\n            return [];\n        }\n        $this->filterByModels($primaryModels);\n        /** @var ActiveRecord $primaryModel */\n        $primaryModel = reset($primaryModels);\n        return $this->asArray()->all();\n    }\n```\n\nI've simply removed `->getDB()` part in last line. In that case as far as I understand Yii::getDb() is used under the hood, so it may bring some problems if other than default connection was used.\nThis simple fix gives the exact expected result.\nSadly I can't come up with better fix without going deeper in the code, but I can do it in 2-3 days when I have some more spare time, if I can be of any help.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://ap